diff --git a/doc/changelog.asciidoc b/doc/changelog.asciidoc
index fcf3d4718..cc12d1f5b 100644
--- a/doc/changelog.asciidoc
+++ b/doc/changelog.asciidoc
@@ -38,6 +38,11 @@ Fixed
 - Errors while reading the state file are now displayed instead of causing a
   crash.
 - Crash when using `:debug-log-level` without a console attached.
+- With `url.open_base_url` set, a search like `:open ddg wiki` opened the base
+  URL of the `wiki` search engine (if one was defined) instead of searching
+  for "wiki".
+- With `url.auto_search` set to `never`, `url.open_base_url` now also applies
+  when only a search engine name is entered, instead of opening it as a URL.
 
 v1.8.1 (2019-09-27)
 -------------------
